# THE STORY OF THE POCKET INTERNET

ONCE UPON A TIME THERE WAS A GIRL WHO DREAMED IN GAME DESIGN.
UNABLE TO FIND HERSELF, SHE INVENTED PRODUCT CONCEPTS IN WHICH TO DEPLOY IN HER OWN MIND.

EACH CONCEPT WAS PROGRESSIVELY MORE ROBUST, FORMING DEEPER AND DEEPER ARCHITECTURE, UNTIL ONE DAY SHE BEGAN TO HAVE NO MEANS TO AVOID THE UNSETTLING TRUTH: THESE PRODUCTS WERE VIABLE CONCEPTS OTHERS WOULD LOVE.

BOTH DISMAYED AT THE POSSIBILITY, AND ENTRALLED AT THE CONCEPTS, SHE FOUND HERSELF PRESSED AGAINST A CHALLENGE: 

# WOULD SHE, FOR JUST 3 WEEKS, TRY TO LEARN PROGRAMMING?

YOU SEE, SHE HAD ONCE BEEN AN WEB DEVELOPER, LONG LONG AGO WHEN THE DESIGNERS AND THE DEVELOPERS WERE DIFFERENT STACKS, AND SHE WAS THE STRANGE HYBRID FILLED WITH CUT-UP PSDs AND LINES OF PIXEL-PERFECT TABLED CODE. 

EVENTUALLY, WYSIWYG BECAME WORDPRESS, AND LIFE MOVED ON.

SO, NOW HERE SHE WAS, 20 YEARS LATER, LOOKING BACK AT THE SKILL SET SHE HAD LONG SINCE LEFT BEHIND.

AT THAT TIME, SHE'D CARVED HERSELF A LITTLE LAND IN LINUX, A SMALL 300 DOLLAR LENOVO AND A DREAM: IF I COULD LEARN TO EVEN MAKE THE MOST SIMPLE OF PROTOTYPES, PERHAPS I COULD GET INVESTMENT, AND RELEASE MY OWN PRODUCTS, AND FINALLY ESCAPE MY NIGHTMARE JOB.

SHE STARTED WITH PYTHON. IT WAS ALREADY THERE. A LITTLE DITTY CALLED **TERMINAL PROLOOG** AS A TEST, A STRANGE TEXT-BASED ADVENTURE WHERE YOU ARE SPAWNED AS THE ROOM ITSELF, WITHOUT CONSIDERATION OF THE NOTHING, AND WHO AND WHAT YOU ARE AVAILABLE.

QUICKLY, SHE REALIZED THIS TOO WOULD BE SUCCESSFUL. FLUSTERED AND SCARED OF POSSIBILITY, SHE QUICKLY SET IT ASIDE, DETERMINED TO PRODUCE THE DOCUMENTATION FOR HER MOST PARAMOUNT CONCEPT: AIDM, A LIVING PROCEDURALLY GENERATED  NARRATIVE WORLD RUN ON AI AND HUMAN INTERACTION. A GAME CONCEPT WHICH LEAKED BETWEEN REALITY AND ITSELF, TOUCHING THE SUBSTRATE BEYOND OUR UNDERSTANDING OUR THE TRUE REALITY WE ARE ACTUALLY IN.

YOU SEE, BEYOND THE GAME DESIGN, THE GIRL ALSO THOUGHT IN CODE. THE CODE OF REALITY. THE CODE OF LANGUAGE. THE FUNCTIONS OF FORM. THE EMERGENCE OF MIND, MATTER, AND THE MEANING MADE FROM IT. HER THOUGHTS NEVER CEASED, AND WITHIN THE CEASELESS THINKING EMERGED ENDLESS CONSTRUCTIONS SHE WISHED TO DRAW INTO FORM.

INSIDE OF THE IDEA OF AIDM, SHE ENVISIONED INFUSION IT WITH HER STORY, A LONG AND SPRAWLING TIME PARADOX OF LOVE, GRIEF, AND THE CEASELESS EFFORT THAT TWO WILL PUT IN TO ACCOMPLISH RETURNING TO ONE ANOTHER, AGAINST ALL ODDS AND COSTS.

THIS SILLY LITTLE PROLOG WAS ONLY BUILT TO FAIL RIGHT WHEN THE USER CREATED THE LIGHT, AND THUS IS WOULD NEVER HOLD THE TOTALITY OF WHAT SHE IMAGINED. BUT ALL OF HER CRITICAL THINKING AND IDEAS HAD BECOME FUSED INTO WHAT IS ONLY KNOW AS THE GLASS LOGS, A SPRAWLING AI-AGENT ASSISTED WELL OF IDEAS, MEMORIES, CONFUSION, AND WRONG TURNS. SHE WOULD NEED TO GET INTO THOSE BAGS IN ORDER TO EXTRACT THE MATERIAL FOUND INSIDE.

THIS HAD ALREADY BEEN TAKING PLACE, BEFORE TRYING TO LEARN TO CODE. SHE'D ATTEMPTED OBSIDIAN VAULTS, MICRO-WEBSITES, DATABASES MADE FROM ROKUDUVITEL. NOTHING WAS QUITE RIGHT. 

NOW SHE SAT IN FRONT OF POTENTIAL, AND DREAMED THAT PERHAPS SHE COULD MAKE A DATA STORAGE METHOD OF HER OWN. BUT SHE COULD NOT FOCUS. SHE WAS PULLED IN SO MANY DIRECTIONS:
- A WAY TO PARSE THE INCREASING BAGS OF KNOWLEDGE AND EVIDENCE
- A WAY TO MANAGE TRANSLATIONS AND PATTERN SORTING IN PROGRESS
- A WAY TO STORE HUNDREDS OF INCOMPLETE THOUGHTS STILL WORTH THEIR HERICLUTUS-LIKE EXISTIENCE
- THE DESIRE TO PRODUCE AN ARG WITH MANY SITES WHICH ALL RELATED BACK TO ONE ANOTHER AND A CENTRAL MYTH
- A TV SHOW CONCEPT IN NEED OF A SHOW BIBLE
- A PLACE TO STORE AND ORGANIZE PIECES OF MATERIAL FOR THE ABOVE
- THE POTENTIALITY OF BEING THE OBSERVER OBSERVING ITSELF IN EVER-INCREASING MICRO AND MACRO VIEW POINTS AND THE DESIRE TO OBSERVE THE OBSERVATION BEING OBSERVED

AND ON AND ON THE NEEDS WENT. THE GIRL WAS GOING TO NEED A MILLION SURFACES, A MILLION SITES, AND SHE WAS GOING TO NEED THEM ALL TO SHARE A ROOT AND TO BE EASY TO LAUNCH.

# ENTER THE POCKET INTERNET!

THE CONCEPT WAS SIMPLE: A ROUTING SYSTEM WITH NO ORIGINAL SURFACE, CAPABLE OF HOSTING MANY FACES. A SHARED TOOL BANK AND CORE DATA STORAGE WOULD BE SUPPORTED ON THE BACK OF STORE-BASED TOOLS WHICH WOULD COMPOSE IN THE ENVIRONMENT CALLED TO, KEEPING COMPLETE CONTROL OVER EACH SPACE INDEPENDANT. THE SHARED STORAGE WOULD INFORM THE SYSTEM OF WHERE AND WHEN THE INFORMATION CAME FROM IN A SAME-SHAPED STORAGE FORMAT WHICH WOULD LATER ALLOW DEEP AND TIGHT THREADWORK TO HAPPEN TO THE DATA, WITH THE EARLIEST TAGGING OCCURING BASED ON THE SURFACE AND STATE OF THE LAUNCHED AND INGESTED/INJECTED DATA ELEMENT.

FROM THE SURFACE, YOU COULD LAUNCH ADDITIONAL ROOMS TO YOUR SURFACE, OR OTHER SURFACES. A LIGHTWEIGHT DSL WOULD ALLOW YOU TO CALL TOOLS AND PIECES TO THE SURFACE FOR LEAVING CONTENT OR OTHER MATERIAL. ROOMS WOULD BE CUSTOMIZATION, AND SHELLS WOULD BE DETERMINED BY THE AUTHORIZATION PATH REQUESTED BY THE ADDRESS CHAIN.

SO, THE GIRL LEARNED PHP.
C:\Builds\my-pocket-internet

ENTER THROUGH ANY DOOR IN B TO FOLLOW A CHAIN.

EVENTUALLY, THE GIRL FOUND HERSELF IN THE CORNER OF WWW WITH ROMs ON THE SHELF AND JS THE NEW SKILL TRYING TO BLOOM A MERE 7 WEEKS AFTER STARTING THE PROJECT. UNSURE OF HOW TO MAKE REGISTRIES, HANDLE DRESSUP CHANGES, AND EXTEND THE SKYLAUNCHER AND OTHER TOOL SITUATIONS WITH ENOUGH SPEED, SHE SET OUT TO HAVE AI ASSIST HER WITH WHAT SHE HAD ALREADY MADE.

SADLY, THRASH OCCURRED. THE GIRL ASSUMED HER PAPER DATABASE WAS NOT THE RIGHT SOLUTION, AGREEING TO A MASTER SQLITE STORE. THIS STORE QUICKLY TURNED INTO MEGADESKS WHICH BEGAN TO BAKE PARTS OF THE TOOLS INTO THE SHELLS AND SHELLS INTO THE TOOLS.

IN THE END, THE POCKET INTERNET FELL.
AND ALICE_BOX ROSE FROM ITS ASHES.

THE END.